[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8580.07, "timestamp": "02:23:00", "text": "现在是牛仔BBOP。现在。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8581.51, "timestamp": "02:23:01", "text": "惊人的。我说服老板去看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8585.75, "timestamp": "02:23:05", "text": "进击的巨人。当然。我做了。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8586.87, "timestamp": "02:23:06", "text": "也就是说，这是一场争论。我有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8588.63, "timestamp": "02:23:08", "text": "争论。你知道吗，我当时什么都不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8590.07, "timestamp": "02:23:10", "text": "然后他就说：“你知道吗？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8592.15, "timestamp": "02:23:12", "text": "我的意思是，这些当然就像……它们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8593.83, "timestamp": "02:23:13", "text": "我觉得这很幼稚。” 我当时就想，“你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8595.51, "timestamp": "02:23:15", "text": "找不到比这更具政治性的东西了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8598.23, "timestamp": "02:23:18", "text": "你再也找不到比这更……嗯……你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8600.389, "timestamp": "02:23:20", "text": "知道，就像……的影子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8601.99, "timestamp": "02:23:21", "text": "现实生活。进击的巨人。如果真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8604.87, "timestamp": "02:23:24", "text": "你看，它实际上确实……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8606.79, "timestamp": "02:23:26", "text": "这就像是对发生的事情的一种隐喻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8608.309, "timestamp": "02:23:28", "text": "现实生活。我当时就想，就等着瞧吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8612.87, "timestamp": "02:23:32", "text": "它。如果你不这样做，我就会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8614.95, "timestamp": "02:23:34", "text": "你知道，你总能说服我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8616.95, "timestamp": "02:23:36", "text": "这是卡通片。他看了。而他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8619.11, "timestamp": "02:23:39", "text": "看了之后我意识到，问题是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8621.83, "timestamp": "02:23:41", "text": "甚至连《攻击》的世界地图都是如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8625.91, "timestamp": "02:23:45", "text": "泰坦星是与地球地图完全相反的世界地图。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8628.71, "timestamp": "02:23:48", "text": "是的。是的。确实如此。有这么多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8630.71, "timestamp": "02:23:50", "text": "《进击的巨人》中有很多东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8632.79, "timestamp": "02:23:52", "text": "你知道吗，伙计，还在寻找中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8636.07, "timestamp": "02:23:56", "text": "昨天我在《进击的巨人》里发现了一些相关的线索。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8638.71, "timestamp": "02:23:58", "text": "提到哥特·马萨实际上是"}]